<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Animal</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Miike Snow</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Miike Snow (Deluxe Edition)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0X9wubEYVnWE6S4p03ezrx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.770" end="00:11.690">ANIMA</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.690" end="00:19.690">杜德伟</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.040" end="01:56.620">[00:20.01]为觅得丝丝证据你在洒泪</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.620" end="02:03.270">[00:27.96]并胡乱猜测真情变了罪</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.270" end="02:11.270">[00:34.99]但若然不需证据也没猜忌</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.410" end="02:17.140">[00:42.75]便才是真的爱并无虚</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.140" end="02:21.760">[00:48.67]可惜你旧情掉向火堆</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.760" end="02:25.280">[00:53.29]那分热情入了雪堆</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.280" end="02:29.340">[00:56.62]令我似受罪令你负累</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.340" end="02:37.340">[01:00.68]但我为你苦追</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.800" end="03:12.940">[02:33.23][01:04.73]一颗心窝失去</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.940" end="03:17.200">[02:35.82][01:06.95]别了空空的身躯风中飘去</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.200" end="03:21.080">[02:40.25][01:11.76]怎可找到心做证据</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.080" end="03:24.780">[02:43.77][01:15.64]北风却将我吹</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.780" end="03:27.920">[02:47.65][01:19.16]一颗心窝失去</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.920" end="03:31.990">[02:50.61][01:22.11]在你水汪汪的双眼倒影里</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.990" end="03:35.310">[02:54.86][01:26.37]星光仿佛黯淡去</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.310" end="03:39.200">[02:58.00][01:30.06]心失去不可追</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.200" end="03:40.700">[03:01.88][01:33.54]寻anima</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.790" end="01:46.790">{music}</p></div></body></tt>